        "ru-extract.jsonl": [],
        "nl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "3548f240-6b4a-37f4-b7cd-bdbee54d5317",
                "word": "uitduiden",
                "pos": "verb",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b2b5787a-5bab-313b-badf-be719eacccfb",
                        "entry_id": "3548f240-6b4a-37f4-b7cd-bdbee54d5317",
                        "glosses": [
                            "uitleggen, uiteenzetten, beschrijven"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "95936d23-0b4d-4665-bb72-63b897b57764",
                                "sense_id": "b2b5787a-5bab-313b-badf-be719eacccfb",
                                "text": "„Maar kan je 't dan niet zoo'n beetje uitduiden, Piet? Als Moeder het wist, kon ze je misschien helpen.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0a9842e3-1784-4e47-9fcf-db3b32e1184c",
                        "source_entry_id": "3548f240-6b4a-37f4-b7cd-bdbee54d5317",
                        "source_sense_id": "b2b5787a-5bab-313b-badf-be719eacccfb",
                        "source_sense_description": "uitleggen, uiteenzetten, beschrijven",
                        "target_lang_word": "suggest",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "suggest",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5ec6f51e-5724-3c2d-bcc2-2000f2721cd9",
                                        "entry_id": "1e541bc1-de47-3a9a-976f-e0aa31a2839b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To imply but stop short of explicitly stating (something)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0be89e1c-d7bb-4500-aaab-da0d833adacc",
                                                "sense_id": "5ec6f51e-5724-3c2d-bcc2-2000f2721cd9",
                                                "text": "Are you suggesting that I killed my wife?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e850d307-a804-340b-9955-d5e97ac4c555",
                                        "entry_id": "1e541bc1-de47-3a9a-976f-e0aa31a2839b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cause one to suppose (something); to bring to one's mind the idea (of something)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d6483631-c844-409b-8b4a-08c5fa61e3cb",
                                                "sense_id": "e850d307-a804-340b-9955-d5e97ac4c555",
                                                "text": "The name \"hamburger\" suggests that hamburgers originated from Hamburg."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6937afe2-1572-4fbf-b448-eefd0aa081a3",
                                                "sense_id": "e850d307-a804-340b-9955-d5e97ac4c555",
                                                "text": ", Book II, Chapter III\nSome ideas […] are suggested to the mind by all the ways of sensation and reflection."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "141a0286-a7f8-41d2-8030-1f22aaca4014",
                                                "sense_id": "e850d307-a804-340b-9955-d5e97ac4c555",
                                                "text": "In the abstract, Stuhlbarg’s twinkly-eyed sidekick suggests Joe Pesci in Lethal Weapon 2 by way of late-period Robin Williams with an alien twist, but Stuhlbarg makes a character that easily could have come across as precious into a surprisingly palatable, even charming man."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3f185e66-6c8a-4a97-8822-b084bbfe3fae",
                                                "sense_id": "e850d307-a804-340b-9955-d5e97ac4c555",
                                                "text": "The [British Heart Foundation's] data […] suggests there has been little improvement in eating, drinking and exercise habits in spite of the concern about obesity and the launch of the government's child measurement programme, which warns parents if their children are overweight. About a third of under-16s across the UK are either overweight or obese."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "79df55d5-4e5d-3194-b591-8331c3b998f0",
                                        "entry_id": "1e541bc1-de47-3a9a-976f-e0aa31a2839b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To explicitly mention (something) as a possibility for consideration, often to recommend it."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b0e367f8-afca-4d3e-9790-c21448d1a276",
                                                "sense_id": "79df55d5-4e5d-3194-b591-8331c3b998f0",
                                                "text": "This meeting venue was suggested to us by our boss."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f1aebeee-8720-4620-a68b-69083d7b6c51",
                                                "sense_id": "79df55d5-4e5d-3194-b591-8331c3b998f0",
                                                "text": "He suggests that we celebrate with dinner at Bellissimo. He suggests our celebrating with dinner at Bellissimo."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b827ca7d-9d82-4f4d-abfb-191f005d44cb",
                                                "sense_id": "79df55d5-4e5d-3194-b591-8331c3b998f0",
                                                "text": "The guidebook suggested that we visit the local cathedral, so that's what we did."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7275ad3c-8741-463f-9117-eeefe0421b32",
                                                "sense_id": "79df55d5-4e5d-3194-b591-8331c3b998f0",
                                                "text": "But Rachida Dati has now turned on her own party elite with such ferocity that some have suggested she should be expelled from the president's ruling party."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "988fd00c-87ac-40ad-8592-2ebc5a1d746c",
                                                "sense_id": "79df55d5-4e5d-3194-b591-8331c3b998f0",
                                                "text": "Nothing was too small to receive attention, if a supervising eye could suggest improvements likely to conduce to the common welfare. Mr. Gordon Burnage, for instance, personally visited dust-bins and back premises, accompanied by a sort of village bailiff, going his round like a commanding officer doing billets."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "117fe8a1-74df-36f1-b461-80d91363456b",
                                        "entry_id": "1e541bc1-de47-3a9a-976f-e0aa31a2839b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To seduce; to prompt to evil; to tempt."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3c9a4de2-1169-43f2-8584-49130c5b7bd7",
                                                "sense_id": "117fe8a1-74df-36f1-b461-80d91363456b",
                                                "text": "Knowing that tender youth is soon suggested."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3b6f95d9-e4c5-420d-81e7-3e76a063ff79",
                        "source_entry_id": "3548f240-6b4a-37f4-b7cd-bdbee54d5317",
                        "source_sense_id": "b2b5787a-5bab-313b-badf-be719eacccfb",
                        "source_sense_description": "uitleggen, uiteenzetten, beschrijven",
                        "target_lang_word": "indicate",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "indicate",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0104d562-bed1-36fd-9f49-8fc88e9f7d68",
                                        "entry_id": "1ec7af55-f3f4-31ab-848b-b25053e04ed8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To point out; to discover; to direct to a knowledge of; to show; to make known."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8fc03d51-8f5e-4fc3-8282-7701fd7a563b",
                                                "sense_id": "0104d562-bed1-36fd-9f49-8fc88e9f7d68",
                                                "text": "The guard blew his whistle to indicate imminent departure."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa0a9b5f-352d-4432-8f63-69a69ba39735",
                                                "sense_id": "0104d562-bed1-36fd-9f49-8fc88e9f7d68",
                                                "text": "With just the turn of a shoulder she indicated the water front, where, at the end of the dock on which they stood, lay the good ship, Mount Vernon, river packet, the black smoke already pouring from her stacks."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5faba48-46e6-46e9-a5ff-a4c338165be5",
                                                "sense_id": "0104d562-bed1-36fd-9f49-8fc88e9f7d68",
                                                "text": "The story struck the depressingly familiar note with which true stories ring in the tried ears of experienced policemen.[…]The second note, the high alarum, not so familiar and always important since it indicates the paramount sin in Man's private calendar, took most of them by surprise although they had been well prepared."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a36403b9-1b6b-4fa3-b0a7-4d6700793bb4",
                                                "sense_id": "0104d562-bed1-36fd-9f49-8fc88e9f7d68",
                                                "text": "Many genes with reproductive roles also have antibacterial and immune functions, which indicate that the threat of microbial attack on the sperm or egg may be a major influence on rapid evolution during reproduction."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3b31ef3c-5bae-361a-8a49-9e79b0083323",
                                        "entry_id": "1ec7af55-f3f4-31ab-848b-b25053e04ed8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To show or manifest by symptoms."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eaf02a7c-468b-465f-8439-01b1b51d539c",
                                                "sense_id": "3b31ef3c-5bae-361a-8a49-9e79b0083323",
                                                "text": "Great prostration of strength indicates the use of stimulants."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "78105a9f-4aeb-3d74-bb99-1e27bfcdfab8",
                                        "entry_id": "1ec7af55-f3f4-31ab-848b-b25053e04ed8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To point to as the proper remedies."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ace279e7-3a0b-497a-b194-3f6d1a32121c",
                                                "sense_id": "78105a9f-4aeb-3d74-bb99-1e27bfcdfab8",
                                                "text": "It was strange to buy things I used to consider luxuries but were now medically indicated, like air conditioning and well-made shoes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "953a57d6-77c7-3113-a5c0-eeb7499a0edc",
                                        "entry_id": "1ec7af55-f3f4-31ab-848b-b25053e04ed8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To signal in a vehicle the desire to turn right or left."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7725e69b-5551-3da3-be0d-17596143ead0",
                                        "entry_id": "1ec7af55-f3f4-31ab-848b-b25053e04ed8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To investigate the condition or power of, as of steam engine, by means of an indicator."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40bbaa8d-7a7c-4c5c-810f-f020aaa90387",
                                                "sense_id": "7725e69b-5551-3da3-be0d-17596143ead0",
                                                "text": "To a person who is familiar with the use of an indicator, whether it be of one make or another, it is needless to give instructions as to how an engine should be indicated,[…]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e2b76e4d-a27e-4114-aa35-f14265512a7e",
                                                "sense_id": "7725e69b-5551-3da3-be0d-17596143ead0",
                                                "text": "I found it fully as easy to indicate an engine at a speed of 320 to 340 revolutions as at 80."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "97fc1942-5e01-4896-8ea3-34c5410e5762",
                                                "sense_id": "7725e69b-5551-3da3-be0d-17596143ead0",
                                                "text": "An indicator will give the working of these valves at all times and soon return its cost in higher engine efficiency. The day has passed when it was only the expert who could indicate an engine or afford to own an indicator."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
